{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-azizi-star","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"azizi-star-azizi-developments-al-furjan","about":"Azizi Star is a 12-storey building in the Al Furjan neighborhood by the renowned developer Azizi. The project offers studios and 1-2 bedroom apartments with panoramic views of Jumeirah Lake Towers and Dubai Marina. This impressive development offers fully serviced and furnished apartments. Residents can enjoy open and spacious living spaces with futuristic and trendy designs, ideally designed for family living.The complex offers a wide range of lifestyle and recreational amenities including a fitness center, gym, adult and children's pool, retail stores and cafes, recreation areas and game rooms. The complex has 24-hour video surveillance, parking, security and concierge.The project is located next to the road Jebel Ali-Al Hibab, which can be used to reach the city center. The world's largest shopping center Dubai Mall or the famous Burj Khalifa Tower will take 27 minutes to reach.The Arbor School, Al Adil Supermarket and Al Barakah Grocery are within walking distance of Azizi Star. The nearest nursery is Blossom Marina Nursery Dubai, a 14-minute drive away. It is located right by the Persian Gulf. Aster Hospital is a 7-minute drive away. And a 9-minute drive takes you to Ibn Battuta Mall with stores for clothing, household items, furniture, and children's products.","price":8824000,"title":"Azizi Star","bitrix":{"id":886,"pf_id":"are.2.8951","source":null,"project_id":"Azizi Star","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Azizi Star","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Azizi Developments","project_location":"Al Furjan"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1146/images/2024/07/29/340x252/PxJyafGfwaQzW6mDBlsDYYwFSa6eTrAEgGFCdg3p.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1146/images/2024/07/2